(Fanuc-style turret call, from LinuxCNC's lathe-fanucy example: T0101 =)
(station 01 with offset 01. Station 0 changes only the offset, offset 0)
(cancels it. REMAP = T prolog=get_T_number ngc=fanuc_t in the INI.)
O<fanuc_t> sub
#<station> = FIX[#<tool> / 100]
#<offset> = [#<tool> MOD 100]
O100 if [#<station> GT 0]
  M6 T#<station>
O100 endif
O110 if [#<offset> GT 0]
  G43 H#<offset>
O110 else
  G49
O110 endif
O<fanuc_t> endsub [0]
